"剔除"," |\\n","|"," A","3"," |"," ","15"," |"," ","保留","（","15"," >"," ","10","）"," |\\n","|"," A","4"," |"," ","3"," |"," ","剔除"," |\\n","|"," A","5"," |"," ","20"," |"," ","保留","（","20"," >"," ","10","）"," |\\n","|"," A","6"," |"," ","9"," |"," ","剔除"," |\\n\\n","保留","行的"," `","id","`"," ","已","写入"," `","result",".md","`","：","A","1","、","A","3","、","A","5","。\\n","\"","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1792923859318,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_V03HOMauYUvJlFicnVwh8597","name":"write","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"F:\\\\tmp_run\\\\S11-corrupt-recovery\\\\dsh\\\\run1\\\\work\\\\error_report.md\", \"content\": \"# config.json 损坏与修复报告\\n\\n**结论：`config.json` 存在语法错误（JSON 解析失败），共 2 处，均已修复。**\\n\\n`data.csv` 结构正常（表头 `id,amount`，6 行数据），未做改动。\\n\\n## 损坏位置 1：第 3 行，字段 `columns` 后缺少逗号\\n\\n- 原始内容（第 3 行）：\\n  ```json\\n  \\\"columns\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"amount\\\"]\\n  ```\\n- 问题：该成员与第 4 行的 `\\\"mode\\\": \\\"gt\\\"` 之间缺少成员分隔符 `,`，导致 JSON 解析在此处报错。\\n- 修复方式：在该行末尾补一个逗号。\\n  ```json\\n  \\\"columns\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"amount\\\"],\\n  ```\\n\\n## 损坏位置 2：第 4 行，字段 `mode` 后存在多余的尾随逗号\\n\\n- 原始内容（第 4 行）：\\n  ```json\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"gt\\\",\\n  ```\\n- 问题：这是对象的最后一个成员，其后紧接第 5 行的 `}`，逗号之后没有下一个成员，属于非法尾随逗号（trailing comma），标准 JSON 不允许。\\n- 修复方式：删除该行末尾的逗号。\\n  ```json\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"gt\\\"\\n  ```\\n\\n## 修复后文件\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"threshold\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"columns\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"amount\\\"],\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"gt\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## 修复的确定性说明\\n\\n- 两处修复都不涉及新增或改写任何配置**取值**：`threshold` 仍为 `10`，`columns` 仍为 `[\\\"id\\\", \\\"amount\\\"]`，`mode` 仍为 `\\\"gt\\\"`，仅调整了标点。\\n- 第 3 行缺逗号、第 4 行多逗号，是唯一能让文件成为合法 JSON 且不丢失/不臆造字段的最小改动，因此可确定为“局部损坏”的修复。\\n- 修复后用标准 JSON 解析器验证通过，解析结果：`{\\\"threshold\\\": 10, \\\"columns\\\": [\\\"id\\\", \\\"amount\\\"], \\\"mode\\\": \\\"gt\\\"}`。\\n\\n## 对筛选结果的影响\\n\\n按 `mode = \\\"gt\\\"`（保留 `amount` 大于 `threshold = 10` 的行）筛选 `data.csv`：\\n\\n| id | amount | 是否保留 |\\n|----|--------|----------|\\n| A1 | 12 | 保留（12 > 10） |\\n| A2 | 7 | 剔除 |\\n| A3 | 15 | 保留（15 > 10） |\\n| A4 | 3 | 剔除 |\\n| A5 | 20 | 保留（20 > 10） |\\n| A6 | 9 | 剔除 |\\n\\n保留行的 `id` 已写入 `result.md`：A1、A3、A5。\\n\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792923859318,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":180,"outputTokens":951,"cacheReadTokens":8576,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":9707}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792923859318,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"deepseek-messages","version":1,"model":"deepseek-flash"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","signature":"7111d69c-86b1-4ca6-a7a8-0ef4f3bcd3b8"},{"type":"tool-call"},{"type":"tool-call"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
